                "content": "You cannot drop the last sub-field of a StructArray field, the last vector field of the collection, or a sub-field used by a Function. To remove the whole StructArray field, drop it by name, as shown in the previous example. After a sub-field is dropped, insert and upsert requests that still carry the sub-field are rejected.",
