            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": " and accepted at the Winter Conference on Applications of Computer Vision (WACV) 2025, provides a rich foundation for training and evaluating Vision-Language-Action (VLA) models in autonomous driving. Each data point, which is usually a video clip, contains not just raw visual input but also structured captions describing:",
